    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Adds a Purpose of Transaction" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Purpose of Transaction</p>
            <p>Creates a new Purpose of Transaction with a random mapping reference.</p>
            <step>1. Navigate to Settings → Application Approval Setup. 2. Click Add. 3. Fill in Name and Mapping Reference fields. 4. Save the Purpose of Transaction.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Toast "The purpose of transaction has been added." is displayed.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
